			"date": "2025-09-10T15:05:43.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> i think when it was my job (glitch) i would like to know asap so that i could action on it and make sure that user data was secure. now i have less immediate need and can follow along or just see the writeup afterwards</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
