			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@sil\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>sil</span></a></span> yeah, that’s a good take. it also has me wondering if the project has sufficient staffing. sometimes those post-acquisition things can get kinda lean due to leadership problems</p>",
